{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39649198",
      "title": "Storing Component Style Files Next To Components",
      "sourceHash": "38723649e20ce8f706bac9f27964d2010c36976d5e8649f82a9bdf0455446887",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 2.43,
          "en": "So now that we split",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 5.73,
          "en": "our Components across multiple files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.73,
          "end": 9.81,
          "en": "there also is another part of our project code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.81,
          "end": 13.59,
          "en": "that could also be split across multiple files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.59,
          "end": 16.08,
          "en": "And that would be the styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.08,
          "end": 18.24,
          "en": "Now, of course, here in this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.24,
          "end": 21.3,
          "en": "I prepared some CSS styles for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.3,
          "end": 24.42,
          "en": "because this is a React course, not a CSS course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.42,
          "end": 28.173,
          "en": "Hence, we did not write all that CSS code from scratch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.22,
          "end": 33.24,
          "en": "Nonetheless, this code here, this CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.24,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "which I prepared for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 38.03,
          "en": "of course, in the end contains all the styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.03,
          "end": 41.13,
          "en": "that are applied here to the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.13,
          "end": 43.62,
          "en": "and also the styles that are applied here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.62,
          "end": 46.17,
          "en": "to these core concept items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 50.67,
          "en": "And, therefore, you might want to split this CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.67,
          "end": 55.67,
          "en": "also into multiple smaller Component-specific CSS files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.4,
          "end": 60.39,
          "en": "For that, for example, we could add a header dot CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.39,
          "end": 64.77,
          "en": "in the Components folder next to the header JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.77,
          "end": 68.25,
          "en": "so that these two related pieces of code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.25,
          "end": 70.95,
          "en": "are closely together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.95,
          "end": 75.06,
          "en": "And then here we could go back to index CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 80.06,
          "en": "and grab all these header-related CSS rules here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.27,
          "end": 85.08,
          "en": "So all these rules, which started with header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.08,
          "end": 88.8,
          "en": "cut them and remove them from index CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.8,
          "end": 91.533,
          "en": "and add them to header CSS instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.18,
          "end": 96.53999999999999,
          "en": "Now, with that, you would see that if you save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.53999999999999,
          "end": 98.31,
          "en": "the styling is broken",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.31,
          "end": 100.68,
          "en": "and these styles are gone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.68,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "because React and this project setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 107.1,
          "en": "does not automatically include this header CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.1,
          "end": 109.05,
          "en": "in the loaded webpage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.05,
          "end": 112.35,
          "en": "Instead, you have to tell the project and your code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 116.16,
          "en": "that this CSS file here should be included.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.16,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "And it's the same for the index CSS file, by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 122.7,
          "en": "This is also not magically included.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.7,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "Instead, in the index JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 127.02,
          "en": "we got this import statement here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.02,
          "end": 130.923,
          "en": "which is responsible for including this index CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 134.46,
          "en": "And it's the same for the header CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.46,
          "end": 137.73,
          "en": "If it should be included, we have to import it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.73,
          "end": 141.57,
          "en": "and we would typically do that inside of the Component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.57,
          "end": 143.97,
          "en": "to which those styles belong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.97,
          "end": 146.61,
          "en": "And for this, we can add such a import statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.61,
          "end": 151.02,
          "en": "where we import dot slash header dot CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.02,
          "end": 153.9,
          "en": "And thanks to that underlying build process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.9,
          "end": 156.66,
          "en": "this import statement will be processed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.66,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "and the CSS code will be included in the loaded webpage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 164.403,
          "en": "Hence, if we save this, our styles are back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.51,
          "end": 168.32999999999998,
          "en": "What's important to note here though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.32999999999998,
          "end": 173.19,
          "en": "is that importing such as CSS file in a Component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.19,
          "end": 177.78,
          "en": "will not scope these styles to that Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.78,
          "end": 181.86,
          "en": "which simply means that if we would use a header element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.86,
          "end": 184.32,
          "en": "somewhere else on our page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.32,
          "end": 187.11,
          "en": "those styles here would be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.11,
          "end": 189.36,
          "en": "to that header element as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.36,
          "end": 192.45,
          "en": "even if it's not part of this header Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.45,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "If I would add another header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 196.77,
          "en": "directly here in the app JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.77,
          "end": 198.96,
          "en": "with the built-in header element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.96,
          "end": 201.51,
          "en": "and I would add a H one element in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 201.51,
          "end": 203.671,
          "en": "where I say \"hello world\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.671,
          "end": 208.671,
          "en": "this header would be styled by these styles here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.74,
          "end": 211.352,
          "en": "even though we're not adding this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.352,
          "end": 213.423,
          "en": "in the header Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 214.82999999999998,
          "end": 219,
          "en": "But because these styles here in the header CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219,
          "end": 222.84,
          "en": "are not scoped and limited to this header Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.84,
          "end": 225.3,
          "en": "we would get those styles being applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.3,
          "end": 228.24,
          "en": "to any header element on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 228.24,
          "end": 231.42000000000002,
          "en": "And that's just something to be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.42000000000002,
          "end": 233.57999999999998,
          "en": "Splitting the CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.57999999999998,
          "end": 238.29,
          "en": "into Component-specific CSS files can still make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 238.29,
          "end": 240.78,
          "en": "since it makes it easy to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.78,
          "end": 243.998,
          "en": "which styles should relate to which Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.998,
          "end": 247.88,
          "en": "and since it can make adjusting those styles easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.88,
          "end": 251.64,
          "en": "But it is important to be aware of this limitation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 251.64,
          "end": 254.7,
          "en": "that these styles will not automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 254.7,
          "end": 257.58,
          "en": "be restricted to this Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 257.58,
          "end": 259.95,
          "en": "Later in the course, you will learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 259.95,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "about a solution to this potential problem though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 266.79,
          "en": "and you will learn how the styles could be scoped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 266.79,
          "end": 268.89,
          "en": "For the moment, we'll just leave it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 268.89,
          "end": 271.68,
          "en": "and I'll get rid of this extra demo header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 271.68,
          "end": 275.163,
          "en": "in the app Component and save this project like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.72,
          "end": 277.95,
          "en": "You could now of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 277.95,
          "end": 282.42,
          "en": "also extract all the core concepts styles if you wanted to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 282.42,
          "end": 284.491,
          "en": "and extract all those styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 284.491,
          "end": 289.35,
          "en": "into a core concept dot CSS file if you wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 289.35,
          "end": 292.353,
          "en": "But here for this demo, I won't do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 293.28,
          "end": 297.48,
          "en": "What I will do though is I'll create a separate sub folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 297.48,
          "end": 301.83,
          "en": "in the Components folder for this header Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 301.83,
          "end": 304.74,
          "en": "which I'll therefore also name \"header\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 304.74,
          "end": 308.152,
          "en": "and I'll move the header CSS and header JSX files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 308.152,
          "end": 310.323,
          "en": "into that sub folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 311.16,
          "end": 313.35,
          "en": "This is technically not required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.35,
          "end": 316.32,
          "en": "and also comes down to personal preference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 316.32,
          "end": 319.44,
          "en": "but it can help with structuring your projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 319.44,
          "end": 324.06,
          "en": "since it can help ensure that you can always quickly find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 324.06,
          "end": 327.783,
          "en": "all the files that belong to a specific Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 329.25,
          "end": 331.86,
          "en": "Now, with that folder structure changed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 331.86,
          "end": 333.69,
          "en": "in the app JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 333.69,
          "end": 336.421,
          "en": "I also have to adjust this import statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 336.421,
          "end": 340.35,
          "en": "because now the header JSX file can be found",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 340.35,
          "end": 343.503,
          "en": "in the header sub folder in the Components folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 345.03,
          "end": 347.64,
          "en": "In addition, in the header JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 347.64,
          "end": 350.97,
          "en": "we now also again have to adjust this image import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 350.97,
          "end": 354.78,
          "en": "because now here we have to go up two levels",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 354.78,
          "end": 356.67,
          "en": "to reach the source folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 356.67,
          "end": 359.553,
          "en": "where we can then dive into the assets folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 361.26,
          "end": 363.45,
          "en": "And with those adjustments made,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 363.45,
          "end": 364.92,
          "en": "if we save this now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 364.92,
          "end": 366.99,
          "en": "everything works again as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 366.99,
          "end": 370.2,
          "en": "but now we also have the styles in a separate file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 370.2,
          "end": 373.173,
          "en": "and we have this alternative folder structure.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}